    icon: '🛂',
    title: 'Entry & Visas',
    items: [
      'ETA required',
      'Keep a digital and physical copy of your passport, visa, and travel insurance at all times',
      'Entry fees for Blue Mountains should be paid in AUD — exchange money before arriving',
